  "question": {
    "text": "A body of mass $50 \\mathrm{~kg}$ is lifted to a height of $20 \\mathrm{~m}$ from the ground in the two different ways as shown in the figures. The ratio of work done against the gravity in both the respective cases, will be :\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/S-uVz1Dhc1SH2VTEV9EBncHPilM6gwiUmqP_AgakPLk.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
